  "claim": "borg_get_parsed_pain() allocates strlen(pain) + 1 bytes for ' ' + text + NUL, and its copy loop stops at pos < buflen - 1, so text without [|] markup loses its final character. The suffix_pain entries for NOT_HELD, COMMAND, NOT_COMMAND and SHAPE_FAIL therefore lacked their final punctuation and suffix() never matched the printed line. With strlen + 2 the entries are complete: the four real messages queue 'PAIN:<monster>' and borg_update matches it to the monster; bracketed endings (stun) and pain.txt messages are unchanged.",
